# for 2 on turn 5, defeating it (CR 310.12b): it is cast transformed, Belligerent Regisaur (trample), not itself a spell
# cast "after" it is on the battlefield. Casting Ornithopter on turn 5 gives it indestructible until end of turn; the
# trigger is "whenever you cast", so Bot2's Brainstorm on turn 7 does not, and the turn 5 grant is gone by turn 7.

